1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,450
Barcelona needed 3 goals… in 7 minutes.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:07,700
They’d lost the first leg 4–0. No team had ever come back from that…

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,550
…and PSG had scored an away goal at the Camp Nou.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,600
88 minutes. Neymar… free kick… top corner.

5
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:19,350
91. Penalty… Neymar again.

6
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:24,400
5–5 on aggregate… but PSG still go through, on away goals.

7
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:29,000
One more goal. Final seconds… Neymar lifts it into the box…

8
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:33,200
…and substitute Sergi Roberto stretches out a foot.

9
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:35,150
6–1.

10
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:40,950
The celebrations were so loud, seismographs half a kilometer away recorded a small tremor.

11
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:48,500
Greatest comeback ever… or not even close?
